{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226530","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226530","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1222653001:1":{"text":"オレは海のギャングだったんだが、今は真面目に船大工をやってる。","source_cn":"别看我这样，我早就和水鬼帮说永别了，目前是个正经的船工。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C375C84673687BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222653002:1":{"text":"たまに闇市の仕事も請け負うんだが、あの日、一人の女がやって来てね、どうも言動が怪しかったんだ。","source_cn":"我偶尔也会跟黑市做点生意，那天，有个女的来找我，她鬼鬼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5465B7AAF3231310","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222653003:1":{"text":"服はボロボロで、お金を持っているようには見えなかった。船を買いたいから、知り合いを紹介してくれって言われたんだ。","source_cn":"她穿得很破，不像是有钱的样子，她想买船，托我给她找关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7FB968E1305FFD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222653004:1":{"text":"でも最近は管理が厳しくて、裏社会にまで船の売買を禁じる通達が出ていてね。","source_cn":"但我知道最近管得严，黑白两边都有人放话，禁止任何船只交易。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60AEE29B0D8F0A8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222653005:1":{"text":"あの女から金を稼げないなら、通報で賞金がもらえるかもしれないと思って来てみたんだ。","source_cn":"没挣到那女人的钱，总得让我挣一笔血薇帮的赏金吧，所以我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6008403850244CEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222653006:1":{"text":"なるほど、大体のことは分かった。もっと詳しく教えてくれ。","source_cn":"大致情况我了解了，但是还得仔细问问清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03141CE5262C3B27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222653007:1":{"text":"何でも聞いてくれ、船を欲しがってた女が指名手配犯で間違いない！","source_cn":"我敢确定，买船的那个女人绝对是通缉犯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB400602783FE7905","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1222653007":{"text":"何でも聞いてくれ、船を欲しがってた女が指名手配犯で間違いない！","source_cn":"我敢确定，买船的那个女人绝对是通缉犯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB400602783FE7905","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222653008:1":{"text":"そうでもない……いや、いない、あんたの言うとおりだ。","source_cn":"也不能这么说，不少人还是会买的……呃，我是说，你说得对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43DB0FD16153D364","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222653010:1":{"text":"喋り方も怪しかったんだ。ありゃあ間違いなく後ろめたいことがあるね。","source_cn":"那个女人说话的语气神秘兮兮，一看就是心怀不轨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x392BD800F11B3843","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1222653010":{"text":"喋り方も怪しかったんだ。ありゃあ間違いなく後ろめたいことがあるね。","source_cn":"那个女人说话的语气神秘兮兮，一看就是心怀不轨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x392BD800F11B3843","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222653011:1":{"text":"背はオレよりも低くて、顔は……","source_cn":"她比我矮一些，长相的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB36595B959B7F2E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222653012:1":{"text":"うーん……フードで顔をがっちり覆ってたから、よく見えなかったんだ。","source_cn":"呃……其实，她当时穿着斗篷，把脸遮得严严实实。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC96D056E110136EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222653015:1":{"text":"これで分かっただろ？どう考えても指名手配犯で間違いない！","source_cn":"你们看，这种人怎么想都只能是那个通缉犯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1A4C4AB7E5EE22D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1222653015":{"text":"これで分かっただろ？どう考えても指名手配犯で間違いない！","source_cn":"你们看，这种人怎么想都只能是那个通缉犯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1A4C4AB7E5EE22D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222653016:1":{"text":"だって、指名手配書の特徴と全部当てはまるだろ！？","source_cn":"因为每一条都对上了啊！跟你们通缉令的要求一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B49B532806A9E18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222653018:1":{"text":"す、少なくとも、怪しいやつなのは間違いない……だろ？","source_cn":"至少她非常可疑……吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3578C8F5EA0D8E76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1222653018":{"text":"す、少なくとも、怪しいやつなのは間違いない……だろ？","source_cn":"至少她非常可疑……吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3578C8F5EA0D8E76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222653019:1":{"text":"ああ、もう！フードを被った女だってことしか分からなかったよ！","source_cn":"烦死了！我没看清！只知道是个戴兜帽的女人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2ADE30E0D76A586D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222653020:1":{"text":"けど、指名手配犯以外あり得ないじゃないか。信じられないなら、それでもかまわないよ！","source_cn":"但是除了通缉犯也不可能是别人啊？你们爱信不信吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8197FEEB9B2DDD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"本当に指名手配犯で間違いないのか？","source_cn":"和你交易的到底是谁！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3FB665842BEAEB70","varian